stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> ServiceCreated: Caregiver creates service
    ServiceCreated --> ServiceActive: Caregiver enables service
    ServiceCreated --> ServiceInactive: Caregiver disables service
    ServiceActive --> ServiceInactive: Caregiver disables
    ServiceInactive --> ServiceActive: Caregiver enables
    
    ServiceActive --> BookingPending: Elder books service
    BookingPending --> BookingAccepted: Caregiver accepts
    BookingPending --> BookingRejected: Caregiver rejects
    BookingPending --> BookingCancelled: Elder cancels
    
    BookingAccepted --> BookingCompleted: Service completed
    BookingAccepted --> BookingCancelled: Cancelled by either party
    
    BookingRejected --> [*]
    BookingCompleted --> [*]
    BookingCancelled --> [*]
    
    ServiceInactive --> [*]: Service deleted
    ServiceActive --> [*]: Service deleted